# Code of Conduct - Wale Bolajoko Purple Team Drills

## Core Principle: Test Controls, Not Companies

1. **Lab Only**: All drills run in isolated lab/staging environments I own. No production systems ever.
2. **Evidence Over Exploits**: I document detection, logs, and mitigations. No attack payloads published.
3. **Help Defenders**: This repo exists to make SOCs stronger, not to teach attacks.
4. **ISO 27035 Aligned**: Every drill follows incident management lifecycle.
5. **Zero Tolerance**: If you use this to attack systems without permission, you’re not Purple Team. You’re banned from my network.

**Remember**: Last Man of Defense means I protect people AND data. Ethics first.

